SUMMARY:Nature's Architects
DESCRIPTION:Nature builds without blueprints\, yet every structure serves a clear purpose. The experience begins with a short film that reveals how living organisms design and construct their homes. This is followed by hands-on activities where children explore these ideas further\, testing\, building\, and observing how form responds to need. The workshop connects observation with practical understanding.
